  "description": "Personal and area radiation dosimetry for crewed spacecraft: optically stimulated luminescent dosimeters (OSLiD) for passive dose-of-record, CR-39 plastic nuclear track detectors (PNTD) for high-LET charge spectroscopy, tissue-equivalent proportional counters (TEPC) for real-time dose equivalent, and personal dosimeters worn during EVAs and inside shielded volumes.",
